    "tagline": "Top 1% PhD & Academic Writing | 1200+ Projects ✓",
    "profile_description": "𝗣𝗵𝗗 | 𝗧𝗵𝗲𝘀𝗶𝘀 | 𝗗𝗶𝘀𝘀𝗲𝗿𝘁𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 | 𝗥𝗲𝘀𝗲𝗮𝗿𝗰𝗵 | 𝗝𝗼𝘂𝗿𝗻𝗮𝗹 𝗣𝗮𝗽𝗲𝗿𝘀 | 𝗘𝘀𝘀𝗮𝘆𝘀 | 𝗥𝗲𝗽𝗼𝗿𝘁𝘀 | 𝗔𝘀𝘀𝗶𝗴𝗻𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁𝘀 | 𝗗𝗮𝘁𝗮 𝗔𝗻𝗮𝗹𝘆𝘀𝗶𝘀 | 𝗦𝗣𝗦𝗦 | 𝗡𝗩𝗶𝘃𝗼\n\n𝟭𝟮𝟬𝟬+ 𝗔𝗰𝗮𝗱𝗲𝗺𝗶𝗰 𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗷𝗲𝗰𝘁𝘀 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗹𝗲𝘁𝗲𝗱 ✓\n𝟰.𝟵⭐ 𝗥𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 | 𝟵𝟵% 𝗖𝗹𝗶𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗦𝗮𝘁𝗶𝘀𝗳𝗮𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻\n𝗧𝗿𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗯𝘆 𝗥𝗲𝘀𝗲𝗮𝗿𝗰𝗵𝗲𝗿𝘀 𝗶𝗻 𝟰𝟬+ 𝗖𝗼𝘂𝗻𝘁𝗿𝗶𝗲𝘀\n𝗧𝘂𝗿𝗻𝗶𝘁𝗶𝗻 𝗥𝗲𝗽𝗼𝗿𝘁 | 𝟭𝟬𝟬% 𝗔𝗜 𝗙𝗿𝗲𝗲 | 𝗣𝗹𝗮𝗴𝗶𝗮𝗿𝗶𝘀𝗺 𝗙𝗿𝗲𝗲\n𝗙𝗮𝘀𝘁 𝗧𝘂𝗿𝗻𝗮𝗿𝗼𝘂𝗻𝗱 | 𝗨𝗿𝗴𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗦𝘂𝗽𝗽𝗼𝗿𝘁 𝗔𝘃𝗮𝗶𝗹𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲\n\nWorking on a thesis, dissertation, research paper, essay, report, or journal manuscript? I help students, researchers and professionals develop clear, well structured academic work that meets university and publication standards.\n\nWith over 10 years of experience, I support projects from initial research and planning through writing, editing, referencing, and final refinement.\n\n𝐇𝐎𝐖 𝐈 𝐂𝐀𝐍 𝐇𝐄𝐋𝐏\n\n✔ PhD Dissertations and Theses\n✔ Master's Research and Capstones\n✔ Research Papers and Journal Articles\n✔ Essays, Assignments and Reports\n✔ Research Proposals\n✔ Literature Reviews\n✔ Systematic and Scoping Reviews\n✔ Research Methodology\n✔ Theoretical Frameworks\n✔ Case Studies and Conference Papers\n✔ Editing, Proofreading and Revisions\n\n𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐄𝐀𝐑𝐂𝐇 𝐒𝐔𝐏𝐏𝐎𝐑𝐓\n\nI can assist with research questions, objectives, literature searches, critical analysis, methodology, thematic synthesis, findings, discussions, conclusions, and recommendations.\n\nFor reviews, I also support search strategies, screening, data extraction, PRISMA documentation, evidence tables, and synthesis.\n\n𝐉𝐎𝐔𝐑𝐍𝐀𝐋 & 𝐏𝐔𝐁𝐋𝐈𝐂𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍\n\n✔ Manuscript Preparation and Editing\n✔ Journal Formatting\n✔ Abstracts and Keywords\n✔ Reviewer Response Support\n✔ Citation and Reference Checking\n✔ Publication Ready Tables and Figures\n\n𝐀𝐂𝐀𝐃𝐄𝐌𝐈𝐂 𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘\n\n✔ Turnitin Report Provided\n✔ AI Free and Original Work\n✔ Peer Reviewed Sources\n✔ APA, Harvard, MLA, Chicago, IEEE and OSCOLA\n✔ Professional Formatting\n\n𝐒𝐔𝐁𝐉𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐒\n\nBusiness • Management • Marketing • Finance • Economics • Nursing • Healthcare • Medicine • Law • Psychology • Education • Sociology • Engineering • Computer Science • IT • Data Science • Political Science • Literature • Design Algorithms\n\n𝐖𝐇𝐀𝐓 𝐘𝐎𝐔 𝐑𝐄𝐂𝐄𝐈𝐕𝐄\n\n✔ Well structured academic work\n✔ Accurate citations and references\n✔ Editable Word and source files\n✔ Tables and figures\n✔ Revisions and clear communication\n✔ On time delivery\n\nFrom assignments and essays to PhD research and journal manuscripts, I provide reliable support from initial research through final presentation.\n",
